\f1\fs28 Late, and well away from Gerry's excavation. Next to the dig the reader waits for somebody to find out, and nobody does. Near the ending it sits alongside a restored universe that carries no memory of having been remade: an enormous thing that decided everything, that nobody knew and nobody ever will \'97 the small rehearsal of the large joke.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

